:28.690">I'll </span><span begin="00:28.690" end="00:29.590">undress </span><span begin="00:29.590" end="00:30.730">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.590" end="00:34.570"><span begin="00:32.590" end="00:33.040">Keep </span><span begin="00:33.040" end="00:33.160">it </span><span begin="00:33.160" end="00:34.570">tight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.110" end="00:38.620"><span begin="00:35.110" end="00:35.860">Sometimes </span><span begin="00:35.860" end="00:35.920">the </span><span begin="00:35.920" end="00:36.790">simplest </span><span begin="00:36.790" end="00:37.150">move </span><span begin="00:37.150" end="00:37.300">is </span><span begin="00:37.300" end="00:38.620">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.250" end="00:42.220"><span begin="00:39.250" end="00:39.580">The </span><span begin="00:39.580" end="00:40.390">melody </span><span begin="00:40.390" end="00:40.690">that </span><span begin="00:40.690" end="00:40.870">you </span><span begin="00:40.870" end="00:42.220">choose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.380" end="00:47.350"><span begin="00:44.380" end="00:44.980">Can </span><span begin="00:44.980" end="00:45.940">rescue </span><span begin="00:45.940" end="00:47.350">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.350" end="00:53.860"><span begin="00:47.350" end="00:49.660">A </span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:51.370">hybrid </span><span begin="00:51.370" end="00:51.910">can </span><span begin="00:51.910" end="00:52.990">withstand </span><span begin="00:52.990" end="00:53.230">these </span><span begin="00:53.230" end="00:53.860">things</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.920" end="00:57.880"><span begin="00:53.920" end="00:54.460">My </span><span begin="00:54.460" end="00:55.000">heart </span><span begin="00:55.000" end="00:55.510">can </span><span begin="00:55.510" end="00:56.020">beat </span><span begin="00:56.020" end="00:56.500">with </span><span begin="00:56.500" end="00:57.130">bricks </span><span begin="00:57.130" end="00:57.250">and </span><span begin="00:57.250" end="00:57.880">strings</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.030" end="01:02.710"><span begin="00:58.030" end="00:58.570">My </span><span begin="00:58.570" end="00:59.560">ARTPOP </span><span begin="00:59.560" end="01:00.100">could </span><span begin="01:00.100" end="01:00.610">mean </span><span begin="01:00.610" end="01:02.710">anything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.160" end="01:10.330"><span begin="01:06.160" end="01:06.520">We </span><span begin="01:06.520" end="01:07.210">could</span><span begin="01:07.210" end="01:07.210">, </span><span begin="01:07.210" end="01:07.540">we </span><span begin="01:07.540" end="01:08.050">could </span><span begin="01:08.050" end="01:08.590">belong </span><span begin="01:08.590" end="01:09.460">together </span><span begin="01:09.460" end="01:09.460">（</span><span begin="01:09.460" end="01:10.330">ARTPOP</span><span begin="01:10.330" end="01:10.330">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.330" end="01:14.440"><span begin="01:10.330" end="01:10.630">We </span><span begin="01:10.630" end="01:11.290">could</span><span begin="01:11.290" end="01:11.320">, </span><span begin="01:11.320" end="01:11.650">we </span><span begin="01:11.650" end="01:12.160">could </span><span begin="01:12.160" end="01:12.670">belong </span><span begin="01:12.670" end="01:13.570">together </span><span begin="01:13.570" end="01:13.570">（</span><span begin="01:13.570" end="01:14.440">ARTPOP</span><span begin="01:14.440" end="01:14.440">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.440" end="01:18.640"><span begin="01:14.440" end="01:14.710">We </span><span begin="01:14.710" end="01:15.400">could</span><span begin="01:15.400" end="01:15.430">, </span><span begin="01:15.430" end="01:15.760">we </span><span begin="01:15.760" end="01:16.240">could </span><span begin="01:16.240" end="01:16.780">belong </span><span begin="01:16.780" end="01:17.650">together </span><span begin="01:17.650" end="01:17.650">（</span><span begin="01:17.650" end="01:18.640">ARTPOP</span><span begin="01:18.640" end="01:18.640">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.640" end="01:28.030"><span begin="01:18.640" end="01:19.930">ARTPOP</span><span begin="01:19.930" end="01:19.930">, </span><span begin="01:19.930" end="01:28.030">ARTPOP</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.030" end="01:29.980"><span begin="01:28.030" end="01:28.390">Come </span><span begin="01:28.390" end="01:28.540">to </span><span begin="01:28.540" end="01:29.980">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.520" end="01:34.060"><span begin="01:30.520" end="01:30.940">With </span><span begin="01:30.940" end="01:31.180">all </span><span begin="01:31.180" end="01:31.300">your </span><span begin="01:31.300" end="01:31.990">subtext </span><span begin="01:31.990" end="01:32.110">and </span><span begin="01:32.110" end="01:34.060">fantasy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.630" end="01:37.930"><span begin="01:34.630" end="01:35.050">Just </span><span begin="01:35.050" end="01:35.230">do </span><span begin="01:35.230" end="01:35.530">that </span><span begin="01:35.530" end="01:35.800">thing </span><span begin="01:35.800" end="01:36.070">that </span><span begin="01:36.070" end="01:36.250">you </span><span begin="01:36.250" end="01:37.930">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.820" end="01:42.550"><span begin="01:39.820" end="01:40.180">In </span><span begin="01:40.180" end="01:40.390">a </span><span begin="01:40.390" end="01:41.380">perverse </span><span begin="01:41.380" end="01:42.550">hue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.380" end="01:46.360"><span begin="01:44.380" end="01:44.950">Lovers' </span><span begin="01:44.950" end="01:46.360">kites</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.960" end="01:51.010"><span begin="01:46.960" end="01:47.260">Are </span><span begin="01:47.260" end="01:47.620">flown </span><span begin="01:47.620" end="01:47.770">on </span><span begin="01:47.770" end="01:48.340">beaches </s