.120">try </span><span begin="02:19.120" end="02:19.420">to </span><span begin="02:19.420" end="02:20.080">sell </span><span begin="02:20.080" end="02:20.590">you </span><span begin="02:20.590" end="02:21.160">out</span><span begin="02:21.160" end="02:21.160">, </span><span begin="02:21.160" end="02:21.460">or </span><span begin="02:21.460" end="02:22.150">I</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.150" end="02:26.170"><span begin="02:22.150" end="02:22.600">Could </span><span begin="02:22.600" end="02:23.170">show </span><span begin="02:23.170" end="02:23.710">you </span><span begin="02:23.710" end="02:24.250">all </span><span begin="02:24.250" end="02:24.760">the </span><span begin="02:24.760" end="02:25.570">reasons </span><span begin="02:25.570" end="02:26.170">why</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.200" end="02:31.330"><span begin="02:26.200" end="02:26.800">My </span><span begin="02:26.800" end="02:27.760">ARTPOP </span><span begin="02:27.760" end="02:28.270">could </span><span begin="02:28.270" end="02:28.810">mean </span><span begin="02:28.810" end="02:31.330">anything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.330" end="02:38.560"><span begin="02:34.330" end="02:34.720">We </span><span begin="02:34.720" end="02:35.410">could</span><span begin="02:35.410" end="02:35.410">, </span><span begin="02:35.410" end="02:35.740">we </span><span begin="02:35.740" end="02:36.220">could </span><span begin="02:36.220" end="02:36.790">belong </span><span begin="02:36.790" end="02:37.390">together </span><span begin="02:37.390" end="02:37.390">（</span><span begin="02:37.390" end="02:38.560">ARTPOP</span><span begin="02:38.560" end="02:38.560">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.560" end="02:42.610"><span begin="02:38.560" end="02:38.830">We </span><span begin="02:38.830" end="02:39.490">could</span><span begin="02:39.490" end="02:39.520">, </span><span begin="02:39.520" end="02:39.850">we </span><span begin="02:39.850" end="02:40.360">could </span><span begin="02:40.360" end="02:40.900">belong </span><span begin="02:40.900" end="02:41.740">together </span><span begin="02:41.740" end="02:41.740">（</span><span begin="02:41.740" end="02:42.610">ARTPOP</span><span begin="02:42.610" end="02:42.610">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.610" end="02:46.840"><span begin="02:42.610" end="02:42.910">We </span><span begin="02:42.910" end="02:43.570">could</span><span begin="02:43.570" end="02:43.600">, </span><span begin="02:43.600" end="02:43.960">we </span><span begin="02:43.960" end="02:44.470">could </span><span begin="02:44.470" end="02:44.980">belong </span><span begin="02:44.980" end="02:45.880">together </span><span begin="02:45.880" end="02:45.880">（</span><span begin="02:45.880" end="02:46.840">ARTPOP</span><span begin="02:46.840" end="02:46.840">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.840" end="02:50.530"><span begin="02:46.840" end="02:48.130">ARTPOP</span><span begin="02:48.130" end="02:48.130">, </span><span begin="02:48.130" end="02:50.530">ARTPOP</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.530" end="02:53.650"><span begin="02:50.530" end="02:51.190">Brushes </span><span begin="02:51.190" end="02:51.400">with </span><span begin="02:51.400" end="02:51.940">darkness </span><span begin="02:51.940" end="02:52.180">won't </span><span begin="02:52.180" end="02:52.450">help </span><span begin="02:52.450" end="02:52.720">you </span><span begin="02:52.720" end="02:53.650">create</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.650" end="02:55.780"><span begin="02:53.650" end="02:54.130">Your </span><span begin="02:54.130" end="02:55.270">destiny </span><span begin="02:55.270" end="02:55.420">of </span><span begin="02:55.420" end="02:55.780">self</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.780" end="02:59.650"><span begin="02:55.780" end="02:55.960">But </span><span begin="02:55.960" end="02:56.560">ARTPOP </span><span begin="02:56.560" end="02:56.860">could </span><span begin="02:56.860" end="02:57.220">mean </span><span begin="02:57